  "id": "verbal-abuse",
  "term": "verbal abuse",
  "definition": "Verbal abuse is harmful or aggressive speech directed at a person. In the packet, it refers to patient verbal abuse toward newly graduated nurses, which is often treated as part of the job but can unsettle emotions and influence how people interpret and cope with their work experiences.",
